-- wp_terms/wp_term_taxonomy, links in wp_term_relationships,
-- extra fields in wp_termmeta. One term reused across many events.
--   fevents_event_type  (hierarchical) — category/type of event
--       term meta: fevents_color, fevents_icon_id
--   fevents_venue  (hierarchical) — where (view-only place)
